          "PZT7_C (ch5)"
        ],
        [
          "2",
          "4 (470K)",
          "PZT6_T (ch4)",
          "PZT7_R (ch5), T(ch6)"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Ghosting on the same sensor channels is harder to test – hard to distinguish between ghosting and physical coupling with a manual press."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Tested with SPI = 16Mhz."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Tested on different sensor settling time and vmid settling time (when vmid = on)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "With vmid ON, tested with ADC scan after switching to vmid, and without ADC scan."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Measured relative ghosting and peak-to-peak amplitude of the major signals. Pressure was applied manually (not a systematically accurate method) and by observation, not an accurate measurement."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Results with Vmid OFF:"
    },
